WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:22.506
Beast was waiting in the hallway. "Follow me."

2
00:00:22.507 --> 00:00:27.489
Beast showed Beauty more rooms.

3
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:32.780
"There's the library and the music room.

4
00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:37.749
Enjoy them and the gardens as much as you like."

5
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:41.234
Beauty was confused.

6
00:00:41.235 --> 00:00:46.803
"Beast was awful before," she thought.

7
00:00:46.804 --> 00:00:50.800
"But now he's acting so polite."

8
00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:54.628
Next Beast showed Beauty the kitchen.

9
00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:58.776
"Ask it to make you something."

10
00:00:58.777 --> 00:01:04.470
"Cake, please!" Beauty said.

11
00:01:04.471 --> 00:01:08.790
Poof! A cherry cake appeared.

12
00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:11.245
Beauty was amazed.

13
00:01:11.246 --> 00:01:16.203
"This place has a strange magic," she thought.

14
00:01:16.204 --> 00:01:20.575
They started walking again.

15
00:01:20.576 --> 00:01:25.488
Then Beast stopped in front of closed doors.

16
00:01:25.489 --> 00:01:28.502
"You must never go in here!"

17
00:01:28.503 --> 00:01:31.599
"Okay," Beauty said quickly.

18
00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:43.710
"There's plenty to keep me busy."

19
00:01:43.711 --> 00:01:47.801
In the dining room, a table was filled with food.

20
00:01:47.802 --> 00:01:51.422
Birds flew about, serving them.

21
00:01:51.423 --> 00:01:58.210
Beast held Beauty's chair while she sat.

22
00:01:58.211 --> 00:02:01.331
He sat across from her.

23
00:02:01.332 --> 00:02:04.684
"There is one more rule.

24
00:02:04.685 --> 00:02:09.284
You may never leave until I release you."

25
00:02:09.285 --> 00:02:12.407
"I promise," Beauty said.

26
00:02:12.408 --> 00:02:18.297
"Good," Beast said. "Now you may eat."

27
00:02:18.298 --> 00:02:21.316
Beauty put her napkin on her lap.

28
00:02:21.317 --> 00:02:27.080
She picked up a spoon. "This looks delicious."

29
00:02:27.081 --> 00:02:29.889
Then Beast began to eat.

30
00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:34.163
Beauty gasped as he slurped down soup.

31
00:02:34.164 --> 00:02:37.839
He ripped at meat.

32
00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.176
Food flew everywhere.

33
00:02:41.177 --> 00:02:44.978
"A promise is a promise," Beauty thought.

34
00:02:44.979 --> 00:02:56.124
"He can't help that he's a beast."

35
00:02:56.125 --> 00:03:05.011
They ate together every night.

36
00:03:05.012 --> 00:03:12.215
Before long Beauty started to enjoy herself.

37
00:03:12.216 --> 00:03:16.896
Beast was funny and polite.

38
00:03:16.897 --> 00:03:36.498
He liked hearing about books she read.

39
00:03:36.499 --> 00:03:45.442
Then one night he suddenly looked up.

40
00:03:45.443 --> 00:03:49.895
"Could you ever love me?"

41
00:03:49.896 --> 00:03:56.849
"I . . . er . . ." Beauty couldn't speak.

42
00:03:56.850 --> 00:04:00.951
"I knew it!" Beast roared.

43
00:04:00.952 --> 00:04:04.468
He jumped up and flipped over the table.

44
00:04:04.469 --> 00:04:09.945
Terrified, Beauty ran from the room.

